{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國人氣女團BLACKPINK成員Lisa近日以Louis Vuitton（LV）品牌大使身份出席巴黎時裝周。繼日前時裝騷上以一襲立體藍紫色層疊荷葉邊的復古緊身馬甲造型，演繹高貴名伶風範後，Lisa今日再釋出全新造型寫真。她換上視覺效果極強的亮眼粉紅套裝，震撼一眾網民。</p><figure><img alt=\"Lisa挑戰復古名伶裝扮。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184913641787363328034625.jpeg/TayCM4hfaxBsRgRQu501mWgXGn9TBor140I6vuNCOr4\"/><figcaption>Lisa挑戰復古名伶裝扮。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"亮眼粉紅套裝極吸睛。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184913661547253760948167.jpeg/mK8NgDUYQMRpvojcH_jfDGhk6Q1ePH4Jvv2EW779hFs\"/><figcaption>亮眼粉紅套裝極吸睛。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><p>亮粉套裝化身真人芭比</p><p>Lisa身穿鮮粉紅色粗花短身外套，內搭白色荷葉邊短身背心，下身配上同款極短迷你裙。配合其復古波浪短髮造型與精緻妝容，整體造型宛如活生生的真人版芭比娃娃。</p><figure><img alt=\"化身真人芭比。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184913652319260672234610.jpeg/m_Nh2Bs7H2liXaSmU6gM5aLflfzOlyDD-UWbT_lFm08\"/><figcaption>化身真人芭比。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><p>完美身材比例盡顯九頭身線條</p><p>除了服裝吸睛，Lisa的「神級身材」更成為網民討論焦點。短身上衣與低腰短裙的設計，毫無保留地展示出她零贅肉的平坦小腹與極致「螞蟻腰」，搭配一雙令人目不轉睛的「逆天長腿」，完美呈現黃金九頭身比例。</p><figure><img alt=\"比例驚人！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184913659265421312195437.jpeg/2ea37danqopEy75WkP2GvhVVmiEPTzCstpbE17aWxNc\"/><figcaption>比例驚人！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷螞蟻腰。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261008/1184913656845176832058146.jpeg/4pezVvigkaxxJHs-BdtSbwYjPpcIbHBLqJ8vhaifL4U\"/><figcaption>大騷螞蟻腰。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T16:18:10.610114+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":466,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}